      "summaryMarkdown": "All four criteria hold against their amended wording. FIRST-1: `gh release view v1.0.0` shows a non-draft, non-prerelease release marked Latest with six archives plus `.sha256`, both installers, `sha256.sum` and notes equal to the CHANGELOG 1.0.0 section; Release-plz run 38565396101 (push to main, 03617fb) and Release run 38565448357 (tag v1.0.0 on the same commit, all 10 jobs green) are successful; `gh attestation verify` passes for the Windows x64, macOS ARM64, Windows ARM64 and Linux x64 archives and fails for a modified copy. The 'first run directly performs' variant is covered by the criterion text and is documented in docs/releasing.md and the manual-verification record; the 'ci.yml on the release PR' clause applies only to the PR variant, which did not occur. FIRST-2: on this Mac `~/.rayx/bin/rayx --version` prints `rayx 1.0.0`, `rayx self update --check` reports up to date, a login zsh resolves only `~/.rayx/bin/rayx` (no shadowing copy in ~/.cargo/bin), env.sh is sourced from .zshrc/.profile/.bash_profile; Windows x64 and Linux x64 are explicitly listed as pending follow-ups. WSL-2: the pending item lists the exact expected results and the installer is covered by tests/wsl_install.rs. FIRST-3: RayX commit 86b6d16 (branch feature/rayx-cli-release-pin, PR #2 open against master) replaces RAYX_CLI_REV and both cargo-install steps with RAYX_CLI_VERSION 1.0.0, the versioned installer and `~/.rayx/bin` on GITHUB_PATH in both jobs, updates the comment, docs and memory decision, and leaves no remaining reference to the old pin; the PR's jobs failed to start with the billing/spending-limit annotation (confirmed via the API), and the outstanding green run is recorded as pending. Minor note, not a finding: the doc lists Windows ARM64 rather than Windows x64 among attested archives; Windows x64 was verified here independently. Re-verified after plan revision 3 (rayx is now a reference repository, snapshot ade17bda): the delta is plan-only, the rayx-cli source is unchanged at b1278fa, and RayX PR #2 still has head 86b6d16 and is open. FIRST-3 evidence (RayX commit 86b6d16 and PR #2, reviewed in full, jobs parsed and queued but not started because of billing) is carried as a reference-repository artifact and is anchored in rayx-cli through the pending record in docs/manual-verification.md and the release installer contract in dist-workspace.toml; the dropped `final-rayx-workflow-yaml` check is replaced by GitHub having listed both jobs by name on PR #2.",
